<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Nov C/A gap $31mln vs Oct $20mln - cen.bank.</title>
<headline>Hungary Nov C/A gap $31mln vs Oct $20mln - cen.bank.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's current account deficit was $31 million in November, down from $20 million in October, the National Bank of Hungary said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY C/A BALANCE (in million dollars)</p>
<p>    NOV 96	OCT 96	  JAN-NOV 96     JAN-NOV 95</p>
<p>     -31	   -20	     -1,155	    -2,209</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
